  ('strategy-seed-triple-rsi', 'triple-rsi', 'Triple RSI: SPY daily mean reversion (QuantifiedStrategies, externally pre-validated)', 'Daily mean reversion from QuantifiedStrategies (X post and article, sent by the owner 2026-11-12). Buy at the close when the 5-day RSI is below 30, has fallen three days in a row and was below 60 three days ago, with the close above the 200-day average; sell at the close when the 5-day RSI crosses above 50. Externally pre-validated: the source reports 90% wins on 103 SPY trades since 1993, +1.2% per trade, profit factor 4. That is the source''s claim. Vertex test (2026-11-12, NautilusTrader, SPY 1994-2026): TESTED, FAILED. The 90% win rate reproduces on SPY shares at the close (90.0% on 90 trades, +1.34% per trade, profit factor 5.19), but the rule is in the market 5.3% of days: CAGR 3.4% after 5 bp per side vs 10.7% buy-and-hold, max drawdown -13.8%, Sharpe 0.68. Win rate 80% at the next open, 64% to 80% on QQQ, DIA, IWM, GLD, SLV and USO. Vertex options form (SPY 30-day call debit vertical, 2% of equity at risk): Sharpe 0.22, out-of-sample -0.07, deflated Sharpe 0.01 at N=360: fails the strict gate and the lower bar. Research only: no orders, no deployment, Nautilus disarmed. Spec, study and report: docs/specs/strategies/triple-rsi.md; research_studies id triple-rsi.', 'python', 'backtested', 'docs/specs/strategies/triple-rsi.md', '["research-only","backtest-study","externally-pre-validated","failed","quantifiedstrategies","mean-reversion","rsi","daily","dip-buying","options","defined-risk"]'::jsonb, 'Entry timing', '[]'::jsonb, 'normal', '{"sourceUrl":"https://www.quantifiedstrategies.com/triple-rsi-trading-strategy/","sourceTitle":"Triple RSI Trading Strategy: Boost Your Win Rate to 90% With Backtest and Trading Rules","sourceAuthor":"Oddmund Groette and Håkan Samuelsson, QuantifiedStrategies.com (@QuantifiedStrat on X)","publishedOn":"2026-02-20","claimedMethod":"Backtest of the six stated rules on SPY from 1993, buy and sell at the close. Costs, sizing and RSI type are not stated; the exact rules on the article are for members only. Article dated 2026-02-20, updated 2026-11-11; the owner''s screenshot shows the X post.","claimedMetrics":[{"label":"Instrument","value":"SPY"},{"label":"Trades","value":"103 since 1993 (post: 97)"},{"label":"Win rate","value":"90%"},{"label":"Average gain per trade","value":"1.2%"},{"label":"Profit factor","value":"4 (post: 8)"},{"label":"Equity curve","value":"100,000 to 304,857"}]}'::jsonb)
